  "description": "Opened as its own run rather than continuing run/0018, deliberately and at a cost. item/ledger-mutation-nodes shipped last hour with MUTATION_RULES_EFFECTIVE_AFTER_RUN = 18, so rule 1 -- a Completed spec:10 item must be implements-referenced by a negative Mutation with a non-empty check -- binds from run/0019 onward and grandfathers everything at or below 18. item/home-dashboard is spec:10. Keeping it on run/0018 would have exempted it from the rule this loop shipped an hour earlier, which is gaming its own guard: the run boundary is not a place to buy an exemption. So this run starts here and the rule binds, and item/home-dashboard cannot be recorded Completed without a mutation node that names the assertion shown to fail. run/0018 closes green: main verified at 221b30e across all ten jobs from main's own push run, after decision/0039's fix to the smoke's upload gate."
